    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaargali AABBO Waaqi nama nama fidu, ka gumi isaa balleese gargari firfirsutini d'ufu, akami hama! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti AABBO Waaqi Israeli waan nama nama fidu, ka sila gumi isaa qorqoratuni jed'u, tana: Isani gumi tiyya qorqorachu diddani gargari firfirsitani d'id'imati d'ooftani. Anini amma tana maro isani waan hamtu suni tolchitanifi isani gaargalcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini gumi tiyya ta hafte lafa iti firfirse keesaa guure, lafa worra ta qaraa taaniti galcha. Achiti worri ilmaani heddu d'ale lafa ira dabra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini nama worra fidu, ka worra qorqoratu, iti tolche, duuba worri deebie woma sodaate imudamu, aninileeni deebie worra ingaargalchu. Nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.33.14+JER.33.15+JER.33.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 33.14-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Guyyaani ind'ufa, ka anini d'aloota Daudi keesa nama d'uga toko fohad'e hayyu tolchu. Hayyichi sunini kara dansaani nama fidde, waan d'ugaatifi ka qajeela lafa ch'ufa keesati tolcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa inni hayyu tahu, worri Yuda soda nyaapa jalaa bahe, worri Israelileeni nagayaani taa. Maqaani isaani yaamani AABBO Waaqi d'uga keenna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Guyyaani ind'ufa, ka nami deebie maqa AABBO Waaqa jiru, ka gumi Israeli lafa Misiri keesa baaseni, inkakhanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo fulla suni wonti worri kakhatuni maqa AABBO Waaqa jiru, ka gumi Israeli lafa mirgaatifi lafa inni iti firfirse ch'ufa keesaa galche. Duuba worri lafa isaani keesa taa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waan raagoota ka Yeremiani d'aame",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'e,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
